{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-13","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：不可公度量与可公度量","englishTitle":"If two magnitudes be commensurable, and the one of them be incommensurable with any magnitude, the remaining one will also be incommensurable with the same.","book":10,"number":13,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.13","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.13/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":13,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-13@raw-9301607f25870f52","contentId":"euclid-10-13","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9301607f25870f525602f14151e21ae48137bfa6dbb61bee5716f3db87e93fa2","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-13.statement","euclid-10-13.construction.1","euclid-10-13.proof.1","euclid-10-13.proof.2","euclid-10-13.proof.3","euclid-10-13.proof.4","euclid-10-13.proof.5","euclid-10-13.construction.2","euclid-10-13.construction.3","euclid-10-13.proof.6","euclid-10-13.proof.7","euclid-10-13.construction.4","euclid-10-13.construction.5","euclid-10-13.conclusion","euclid-10-13.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-13.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-13","revisionId":"euclid-10-13@raw-9301607f25870f52","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"db1d0e89092c76be7e0cac458d58f6be8c81e3e5f8e8eacb03292975e545b963","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two magnitudes be commensurable, and the one of them be incommensurable with any magnitude, the remaining one will also be incommensurable with the same."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个量是可公度,其中一个是不可公度, 任何量, 剩下的也将是不可公度, 同一量。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-13.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-13","revisionId":"euclid-10-13@raw-9301607f25870f52","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"77da801995f95c17cbe271bd961fcaa5149e3703e6da24d38ab76dba6fc7af7f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B be two commensurable magnitudes, and let one of them, A, be incommensurable with any other magnitude C; I say that the remaining one, B, will also be incommensurable with C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,B是2 可公度级,让其中1个,A,不可公度个,加上任何其他C级;我说,剩下的B,也将是不可公度个,C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-13.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-13","revisionId":"euclid-10-13@raw-9301607f25870f52","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5707f84d45eb8fa9887301ed437bba6fabe89f1e15536e3c0f785966db81f7c9","citations":["euclid-10-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if B is commensurable with C, while A is also commensurable with B, A is also commensurable with C. [[X. 12](/principles/euclid-10-12)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果B是可公度,C,A也是可公度,B,A也是可公度,可公度也是C,可公度。 [[X. 12](/principles/euclid-10-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-13.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-13","revisionId":"euclid-10-13@raw-9301607f25870f52","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"963053e55cb62f258eee77e2b9134a1f115d4a23d70e9a0361715a9533f7f82d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it is also incommensurable with it: which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它也与不可公度: 这是不可能的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-13.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-13","revisionId":"euclid-10-13@raw-9301607f25870f52","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c58211c1cc11385c6a4ff43019a072b1428ce94a57a301efb667440fb46fe7e0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore B is not commensurable with C; therefore it is incommensurable with it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,B不是可公度和C;因此是不可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-13.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-13","revisionId":"euclid-10-13@raw-9301607f25870f52","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-13.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-13","revisionId":"euclid-10-13@raw-9301607f25870f52","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ebd5d5cf18be2b44b5d07c229dd8283ed69cd85230354c9908ed8bfa8e52e5e1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Lemma. Given two unequal straight lines, to find by what square the square on the greater is greater than the square on the less."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"引理,鉴于两条不均匀的直线, 找到正方形比正方形 数量更大的正方形比小的正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-13.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-13","revisionId":"euclid-10-13@raw-9301607f25870f52","order":7,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"75458b6650b6765616eab0b30d543f025ec9558d866bf05410b84ebbf10640c6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB, C be the given two unequal straight lines, and let AB be the greater of them; thus it is required to find by what square the square on AB is greater than the square on C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB,C成为两个不平等的直线,让AB成为其中的较大数量;因此,它需要找到到正方形时,AB时大于正方形时,C时。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-13.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-13","revisionId":"euclid-10-13@raw-9301607f25870f52","order":8,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3b09649358a0c785a98e0a61dad702447065271e2b196a7b80585916bc20e0bd","citations":["euclid-4-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the semicircle ADB be described on AB, and let AD be fitted into it equal to C; [[IV. 1](/principles/euclid-4-1)] let DB be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ADB半圆圈在AB上描述,让AD在其中安装等于C;让DB连接。 [[IV. 1](/principles/euclid-4-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-13.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-13","revisionId":"euclid-10-13@raw-9301607f25870f52","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ef770b0b25111225fed25af18627a4f3ebb2a2b392efbe1c7539375044faf732","citations":["euclid-3-31","euclid-1-47"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"It is then manifest that the angle ADB is right, [[III. 31](/principles/euclid-3-31)] and that the square on AB is greater than the square on AD, that is, C, by the square on DB. [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此可见,ADB的该角是直角,AB的正方形比AD的正方形,即C比DB的正方形要高。 [[III. 31](/principles/euclid-3-31)] [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-13.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-13","revisionId":"euclid-10-13@raw-9301607f25870f52","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"87a92179ab8d23ae0d4321786c555a5c60a1859f3d91f83ebdb329ce396eecc9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly also, if two straight lines be given, the straight line the square on which is equal to the sum of the squares on them is found in this manner."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,如果给出两条直线,则以这种方式找到正方形的直线,该直线相当于该正方形的总数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-13.construction.4","contentId":"euclid-10-13","revisionId":"euclid-10-13@raw-9301607f25870f52","order":11,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bcd70684cc95d3f56ae5ea7471619e20aea3e31fe693f4c3aa68235fbd29dc70","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AD, DB be the given two straight lines, and let it be required to find the straight line the square on which is equal to the sum of the squares on them."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AD,DB成为两条直线, 让它找到正方形的直线, 直线等于正方形的总数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-13.construction.5","contentId":"euclid-10-13","revisionId":"euclid-10-13@raw-9301607f25870f52","order":12,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"88170af82a7a71daaeb4de4356b682cf4549b9539c46460995eb25741af63bd7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let them be placed so as to contain a right angle, that formed by AD, DB; and let AB be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它们安插起来,装有由AD,DB组成的直角型;让AB型连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-13.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-13","revisionId":"euclid-10-13@raw-9301607f25870f52","order":13,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"11fa5cdd8353e5e2c82476e00c59b24403112e74c791860fd1917738f2d15e39","citations":["euclid-1-47"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"It is again manifest that the straight line the square on which is equal to the sum of the squares on AD, DB is AB. [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)] Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"显而易见,正方形的直线等于AD和DB线的正方形和AB、Q、E和D。 [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-13.source","contentId":"euclid-10-13","revisionId":"euclid-10-13@raw-9301607f25870f52","order":14,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5210e96e9a5175107fa3ddd5418511bbf8aa7d224323a43fd20542a3ef53d247","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.13/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.13\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-13:euclid-10-12:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-13","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-13.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-12","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.13","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1